really understanding specific task for specific AI

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,733
this is very important AI have their strength

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,500
at the same time you also have what you wanna do

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,966
you need to be able to tell specifically

6
00:00:17,066 --> 00:00:18,966
what you want AI to do for you

7
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:21,366
at every point in time for example

8
00:00:21,366 --> 00:00:23,466
when do you need to generate boilerplate

9
