you could use AI for architectural design

13
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,166
but again

14
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,300
what is the unique selling point in whatever you are building

15
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,666
so if you really want something very technical

16
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:49,933
one of the things you can look at is understanding the architecture

17
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:52,400
