you have to recustomize everything to solve the problem at hand

29
00:01:25,666 --> 00:01:29,766
so this is very important that you know the role of the AI

30
00:01:29,766 --> 00:01:31,200
from the beginning of the project

31
00:01:31,366 --> 00:01:32,566
do your own part

32
00:01:32,566 --> 00:01:36,700
use your part to engineer the AI to do something very powerful

33
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,233
